PASS desktop debounce commits exactly once
PASS desktop empty input has one synchronous commit notification
PASS desktop IME only commits after composition ends
PASS desktop create title owns its single notification
PASS desktop unchanged page writes no hidden or page attributes
PASS desktop Picker initially measures through one observer
